WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.250
Week 5: Location, Condition, and Existence. locate a place describe a temporary condition say what is available

2
00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:14.900
Mission brief. Guide someone through a building and report which services are open or closed.

3
00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:24.518
Preparation. Select ten useful words, three linking expressions, and two repair phrases. Plan points rather than a memorized paragraph.

4
00:00:24.518 --> 00:00:32.533
Performance. Complete the task once for fluency, review the evidence, then repeat it for greater clarity and accuracy.

5
00:00:32.533 --> 00:00:41.274
After-action review. Record what succeeded, what blocked communication, and the single change that will matter most on the next attempt.

6
00:00:41.274 --> 00:01:10.711
Model language. Voy a guiar a un visitante por el edificio. — I am going to guide a visitor through the building. Indico qué servicios están disponibles. — I indicate which services are available. Pregunto si el museo está abierto. — I ask whether the museum is open. Confirmo el recorrido antes de salir. — I confirm the route before leaving. Explico dónde está cada servicio. — I explain where each service is.

7
00:01:10.711 --> 00:01:20.865
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
